      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "首页生命周期优先：总览层默认只展示项目、版本、feature、生命周期阶段、总进度、交付状态、blocker、下一步；runtime 仅可压缩显示为 badge。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "CEO 视图极简：首页不得默认暴露 tmux pane、worker transcript、raw debug event、宿主交互洪流。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "项目详情可接力：详情页必须展示版本线、主 PRD / 并行 PRD、需求物料补齐情况、implement / qa / release 状态、推荐 skill / 下一步。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "需求物料显式状态：系统必须对 `prd / user-story / test-case` 至少表达 `missing / draft / ready / frozen`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Runtime 下钻分层：`single / team / ralph` 只在运行态详情层展开，且不作为生命周期主导航。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Team 运行态透明：当 runtime 为 `team` 时，必须可见 agent 数、role、status、role artifact 引用与 session 引用。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Ralph 闭环可观测：当 runtime 为 `ralph` 时，必须可见 `round_count / failure_streak / next_action / current_blocker`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Git / worktree 治理可见：每个版本迭代 / feature 必须可见 repo root、branch、commit、dirty、worktree path、expected branch rule、spec status。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Session 边界受控：看板可以展示 `Codex / Claude` session metadata 与 transcript ref，但不得把宿主完整 session 系统并入 Beacon 真相层。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Projection / truth 边界明确：页面与文案必须明确 `docs/beacon + .beacon` 是 truth，`Beacon Runtime Ledger + PocketBase` 是 projection / control plane。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-011",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "降级与重建成立：当 SQLite / PocketBase 缺失时，看板必须显示 degraded / rebuild 信息，并允许从本地 truth 重建最小可用状态。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-012",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon 外运行时排除：`omc / omx` 与其他 Beacon 外兼容运行时不进入正式投影和默认看板展示。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
          "accepted_at": null,
          "changed_in_revision": null,
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
