          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "生命周期推荐 skill：看板必须基于当前阶段给出推荐 skill，而不是暴露一组无上下文的平铺 skill 列表。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "draft",
          "implemented_by_run_id": null,
          "verified_by_run_id": null,
